# 📱 Mobile Number Validation using jQuery

A modern and responsive web application that validates **Indian Mobile Numbers** using **jQuery** and **Regular Expressions (Regex)**. The application provides **real-time validation**, **operator detection (demo)**, **validation details dashboard**, and a clean user interface.

---

## 🚀 Project Overview

This project demonstrates the implementation of **jQuery-based form validation** for Indian mobile numbers. It validates user input instantly, provides visual feedback, displays validation details, and prevents invalid entries.

The application is designed as a beginner-friendly yet professional mini web application suitable for JavaScript laboratory work and GitHub portfolio projects.

---

## ✨ Features

- 📱 Indian Mobile Number Validation
- ⚡ Real-Time Validation while Typing
- 🔢 Allows Only Numeric Input
- ✂️ Maximum 10 Digits Restriction
- ✅ Success & Error Messages
- 🟢 Green Border for Valid Input
- 🔴 Red Border with Shake Animation for Invalid Input
- 📊 Validation Details Dashboard
- 📶 Mobile Operator Detection (Demo)
- 🌍 Country Information
- 🕒 Validation Timestamp
- 📝 Regex-based Validation
- ⚙️ jQuery Event Handling
- 📱 Responsive User Interface
- 💻 Console Table Logging
- 🔄 Reset Functionality

---

