# 📋 Validation Rules

✔ Mobile number must contain exactly **10 digits**

✔ First digit should start with:

- 6
- 7
- 8
- 9

✔ Only numeric characters are allowed.

✔ Special characters are not allowed.

✔ Spaces are not allowed.

✔ Alphabetic characters are not allowed.

---

# 📊 Validation Dashboard

The application displays:

- Validation Status
- Mobile Operator (Demo)
- Country
- Validation Method
- Date & Time of Validation

---

# 📶 Operator Detection (Demo)

| Prefix | Operator |
|---------|-----------|
| 98, 99 | Airtel |
| 97, 96 | Vi |
| 95, 94 | BSNL |
| 91, 92, 93 | Jio |
| 89, 90 | Reliance |

> **Note:** Operator detection is based on sample prefix mapping for demonstration purposes only.

